<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wireless phone stocks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wireless phone stocks started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Brian Coleman initiated coverage of the wireless telephone stock sector.</p>
<p>-- Paging Network Inc was initiated as strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Arch Communications Group Inc, Centennial Cellular Corp, Mobile Telecommunications Technologies Corp were initiated as buys.  </p>
<p>-- the following were started as neutral: Metrocall Inc, MobileMedia Corp, Palmer Wireless Inc, Pronet Inc, 360 Communications Co, United States Cellular Corp, Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc, Western Wireless Corp.</p>
</text>
